Voting Unit (Unit A):
Included: All full-time, regular part-time and per diem Registered Nurses and RN Advanced Skills employed by the Employer at its facility located at 14900 East Imperial Hwy, La Mirada, California;

Excluded: All other employees, Nursing Supervisors, Nurse Managers, office clerical employees, confidential employees, managers, guards and supervisors as defined in the Act.

Eligible to vote are all employees in the unit, including per diem employees, who have worked an average of four (4) hours or more per week during the 13 weeks immediately preceding the eligibility date for the election.

incl;
